  <a name="0.2.0"> </a>
  <p>
    <b>2025-10-02 v0.2.0</b> - first official draft release, based on FHIR R4
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>BD Patient profile with Bangladesh-specific identifier and address extensions</li>
    <li>BD Practitioner profile</li>
    <li>Identifier CodeSystem and ValueSet: National ID (NID), Birth Registration Number (BRN) and Unique Health ID (UHID)</li>
    <li>Bangladesh Address profile with division, district, upazila and union levels</li>
    <li>Initial examples for Patient and Practitioner</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    This was a pre-release draft; backward compatibility is not guaranteed
    before 1.0.0.
